!! refuses ~ bag-unnamed · fresher-refused

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`bag-unnamed` params=`cure/[[carriage.fresher.reads bag/lares]] ~ --bag names the canon bag`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`fresher-refused` params=`~ the daemon refused the read`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

